.env*.local

# Installed agent skill packages + their lockfile. Tooling for whoever is
# driving an agent locally, not part of the app — and `.claude/skills/*` are
# just symlinks into `.agents/skills/`, which git would store as link files.
.agents/skills/
.claude/skills/
skills-lock.json

